Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Preserve Yaagl MF reader and opt-in game timeout compatibility
Provenance: Historical Wine 11.17 donor patch 0003-zzz-compatibility.patch
  from commit 54f2563 (formerly patches/wine-p3/);
  Yaagl/macports mf/0003-mfreadwrite-reader-Rely-on-the-video-processor-sampl.patch
  (Remi Bernon, CW #20833) and dwproton/gi-timeout 0009-HACK-ws2_32-Allow-
  changing-request-timeout-with-WINE.patch. Adapted to pristine CX26.3 source.
